{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大家在職場上都有另一個身分吧…?救火專員、中級大人、下午茶專家等等。本地文創品牌COOLISTIC 推出「社畜職位牌」，一共有18個職位牌，為大家辦公室生活增添樂趣！例如有卸膊操舞蹈家、廢水採購員、負能量清潔員、資深影印機操作員、巨嬰護理員等等，相信大家一見到都可以馬上聯想到對應那位同事！好有共鳴啊！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179121605061161597_6871671576ac3c9b310a48.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179121605239449771_8251210656ac3c9b4bfa61.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179121605404237663_389602126ac3c9b67d45c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179121605597396525_20600922636ac3c9b854179.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179121605763474676_8438673816ac3c9ba8628c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179121606155767549_4950560376ac3c9bf1fe97.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T16:20:11.814816+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}